&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:13pt;"&gt;工業用フェノール樹脂（レヂトップ）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;特殊フェノール樹脂（ミレックス）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:13pt;"&gt;鋳物用粘結剤（αsystem・βsystem・NFURAN）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;電子材料用樹脂&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:13pt;"&gt;高機能繊維（カイノール）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;真球状樹脂&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:13pt;"&gt;ビスフェノールF&lt;/p&gt;
